# too big
models/
# ...but DO track the deployed vision model blobs: the RK3562 .rknn + its .meta.json
# are committed here and consumed on the SBC via the smartbox-software vendor/katrain
# submodule (plan §14 E3 — atomic with the stone_detector/rknn_backend that reads them).
# `models/` above would otherwise silently swallow this dir (git check-ignore verified).
!katrain/vision/models/
katrain/vision/models/*
!katrain/vision/models/*.rknn
!katrain/vision/models/*.meta.json
katrain/models/*.bin.gz

